# Generated documents. The Markdown in docs/stoa/ is the tracked source; the
# .docx/.pdf are built from it (e.g. docs/stoa/build-storage-paper.py) and are
# never committed. Keep these two patterns broad — they also cover the
# confidential audit deliverables below.
docs/stoa/*.docx
docs/stoa/*.pdf

# Confidential audit deliverables — never commit these
docs/stoa/upstream-audit-findings.md
docs/stoa/upstream-audit-plan.md
docs/stoa/upstream-audit-report.md
docs/stoa/chainweb-3.2-audit.md
docs/stoa/build-audit-docx.py
docs/stoa/vulnerabilities-fixed-in-3.2.md
docs/stoa/build-xchain-paper.py

# Private audit material — the whole folder, never committed.
docs/stoa/_private/
